WEBVTT

00:00:27.248 --> 00:00:28.666
(GRUNTS)
(GASPS)

00:00:29.709 --> 00:00:31.172
What? Where?

00:00:31.961 --> 00:00:33.095
Whoa, foot is asleep.
该死的

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.247
Ah, pins and needles! (GROANS)
跟针扎一样

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.802
SILAS: Good afternoon, Mr. Gru.
下午好 格鲁先生

00:00:39.885 --> 00:00:40.886
Eh.
好

00:00:41.152 --> 00:00:43.499
I apologize for our methods
in getting you here.
抱歉用这种方法把你请来

00:00:43.973 --> 00:00:46.767
I don't. (CHUCKLES)
I'd do it again in a heartbeat.
我可以马上再来一次 不骗你

00:00:46.851 --> 00:00:48.347
I am not gonna lie, I enjoyed that.
我可以马上再来一次 不骗你

00:00:48.863 --> 00:00:51.105
Every second of it.
Gave me a bit of a buzz, actually.
感觉真是爽

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:52.898
That's enough, Agent Wilde.
够了 瓦尔德特工

00:00:53.382 --> 00:00:54.400
Sorry, sir.
抱歉

00:00:54.483 --> 00:00:55.991
Okay, this is bogus!
好了 太过分了

00:00:56.027 --> 00:00:57.194
(CHUCKLES)
好了 太过分了

00:00:57.361 --> 00:00:59.799
I don't know who you people
think you are, but...
我不管你们以为自己是谁 但是...

00:01:00.263 --> 00:01:02.597
We are the Anti-Villain League.
我们是反恶人联盟

00:01:02.992 --> 00:01:08.331
An ultra-secret organization dedicated to
fighting crime on a global scale.
对抗全球规模恶势力的绝密组织

00:01:08.763 --> 00:01:13.628
Rob a bank, we're not interested.
Kill someone, not our deal.
抢劫银行 我们懒得管

00:01:14.181 --> 00:01:18.507
But you want to melt the polar ice caps,
or vaporize Mount Fuji,
但要是你想融化极地冰盖

00:01:18.816 --> 00:01:22.178
or even steal the Moon...
偷月亮

00:01:22.637 --> 00:01:24.722
Then we notice.
那就关我们事了

00:01:24.972 --> 00:01:27.767
First of all, you got no proof that
I did that.
首先 你没有证据证明是我做的

00:01:27.865 --> 00:01:31.106
Second, after I did do that,I put it back!
其次 偷了之后我又放回去了

00:01:31.722 --> 00:01:33.439
We're well aware of that, Mr. Gru.
这我们都知道 格鲁先生

00:01:33.652 --> 00:01:35.184
That's why we brought you here.
所以才请你来

00:01:35.783 --> 00:01:39.334
I am the League's director,
Silas Ramsbottom.
我是联盟的主席

00:01:39.779 --> 00:01:41.162
(SNORTS) Bottom.
屁股

00:01:41.255 --> 00:01:43.115
(CHUCKLING)

00:01:44.383 --> 00:01:46.869
Hilarious. (SIGHS)
真好笑

00:01:46.902 --> 00:01:48.788
Agent Wilde?
瓦尔德特工

00:01:49.093 --> 00:01:50.211
Oh, me now? Ah.
轮到我了

00:01:50.263 --> 00:01:52.598
Um, recently, an entire top-secret lab
最近有个绝密的实验室

00:01:52.661 --> 00:01:54.168
disappeared from the Arctic Circle.
在北极圈消失了

00:01:54.341 --> 00:01:57.662
Yeah, the entire lab, just...
(IMITATES WHOOSHING)
没错 整个实验室 就这样

00:01:58.005 --> 00:01:59.735
Gone. Where did it go?
消失了 它去哪了？

00:02:00.319 --> 00:02:01.509
I don't care.
没兴趣知道

00:02:01.676 --> 00:02:04.011
Hmm. The lab was devoted to experiments
实验室正在研究PX-41

00:02:04.095 --> 00:02:07.431
involving PX-41, a transmutation serum.
是一种变种血清

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:11.519
What is PX-41, you ask?
Mmm, it's pretty bad. Look.
你问我什么是PX-41？

00:02:13.312 --> 00:02:14.313
(GROANS)
(YELP)

00:02:21.112 --> 00:02:22.780
Ah!

00:02:22.988 --> 00:02:24.073
(GROWLS)
(YELLS)

00:02:24.907 --> 00:02:26.117
(ALL GROANING)

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:33.685
Huh, you usually don't see that
in bunnies.
一般的兔宝宝不是这样的

00:02:34.208 --> 00:02:38.212
As you can see, in the wrong hands,
the PX-41 serum
PX-41血清

00:02:38.295 --> 00:02:40.844
could be the most devastating
weapon on Earth.
可能成为地球上最具毁灭性的武器

00:02:41.757 --> 00:02:42.800
(GRUNTS)

00:02:43.138 --> 00:02:47.423
Fortunately, it has a very
distinct chemical footprint.
它有十分独特的化学特质

00:02:47.727 --> 00:02:50.583
And using the latest
chem-tracking technology,
我们利用最新的化学追踪技术

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:54.019
we found traces of it
in the Paradise Mall.
在天堂商场发现它的踪迹

00:02:54.145 --> 00:02:55.254
(SCOFFS) A mall?
商场？

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:58.232
Precisely. And we believe that
one of these
我们相信
那个犯罪高手就是这群店主之一

00:02:58.315 --> 00:03:00.803
shop owners is a master criminal.
我们相信
那个犯罪高手就是这群店主之一

00:03:00.886 --> 00:03:02.027
And that's where you come in.
所以才请你来 作为一名前恶棍

00:03:02.423 --> 00:03:06.615
As an ex-villain, you know how
a villain thinks, how a villain acts.
你肯定了解恶棍的思维和行动

00:03:06.741 --> 00:03:08.743
The plan is to set you up undercover
安排你到商场的店铺里当卧底

00:03:08.826 --> 00:03:10.745
at a shop in the mall, where hopefully...
希望你可以...

00:03:10.941 --> 00:03:13.789
Okay, I see where this is going,
好了 我知道是怎么回事了

00:03:13.873 --> 00:03:17.042
with all the Mission: Impossible stuff,
but no. No!
狗血的动作冒险剧情

00:03:17.408 --> 00:03:20.696
I'm a father now.
And a legitimate businessman.
还是个守法的商人

00:03:20.982 --> 00:03:24.800
I am developing a line
of delicious jams and jellies.
我在生产一系列美味的果酱和果冻

00:03:25.344 --> 00:03:28.095
(CHUCKLING)
"Jams and jellies"?
果酱跟果冻啊

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:30.850
Oh, attitude! That's right!
什么态度

00:03:31.423 --> 00:03:32.992
So, thanks, but no thanks.
谢谢 老子不干

00:03:34.143 --> 00:03:39.064
And here's a tip. Instead of tasing
people and kidnapping them,
给你个建议
与其把别人绑来言语相激

00:03:39.148 --> 00:03:41.629
maybe you should just give them a call!
不如直接给他们打电话

00:03:42.109 --> 00:03:43.689
Good day, Mr. Sheepsbutt.
再见 屁股先生

00:03:44.153 --> 00:03:45.266
Ramsbottom.
是兰皮谷

00:03:45.374 --> 00:03:47.448
(CHUCKLING) Oh, yeah, like that's
any better.
是吗？还是屁股好听些

00:03:47.573 --> 00:03:49.420
-(CHUCKLING) Hello.
-(CHATTERS IN MINIONESE)

00:03:49.475 --> 00:03:51.285
(BLOWS RASPBERRY)

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:03.631
Look, I probably shouldn't be saying this,
(CHUCKLES)
也许我不该这样说

00:04:03.999 --> 00:04:06.385
but your work as a villain
was kind of amazing.
不过你当恶棍真是棒极了

00:04:06.884 --> 00:04:10.375
So, if you ever wanna get back
to doing something awesome,
要是你回心转意想大干一场的话

00:04:12.007 --> 00:04:13.358
give us a call.
给我们打电话

00:04:18.395 --> 00:04:21.106
(CHANTING IN MINIONESE)

00:04:24.235 --> 00:04:25.277
(GRUNTING)

00:04:33.178 --> 00:04:35.120
Hey, I told you guys to get to bed.
我不是叫你们去睡觉了吗？

00:04:35.329 --> 00:04:36.497
Oh, sorry.
抱歉

00:04:36.622 --> 00:04:38.673
-So, when you going on your date?
-What?
你什么时候去约会？

00:04:38.888 --> 00:04:41.544
Remember, Miss Jillian
said she was arranging a date for you.
记得吗？
吉莉安小姐说给你安排了约会

00:04:41.649 --> 00:04:45.714
Yeah, well, she is a nut job,
and I'm not going on any date.
她是个疯子 我不会去约会的

00:04:45.965 --> 00:04:47.697
Why not? Are you scared?
为什么？

00:04:53.848 --> 00:04:54.974
(GASPS)

00:04:55.057 --> 00:04:57.852
Hey, did you guys see
the Moon landing on TV?
你们看电视播的登月报道了吗？

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.479
Yeah, I can't believe it. It's so cool!
你能相信吗？简直酷毙了

00:05:00.978 --> 00:05:02.189
Excuse me? Lisa?
前几天我跟外星人讲话了

00:05:02.273 --> 00:05:03.357
I was talking to Billy the other day.
前几天我跟外星人讲话了

00:05:03.402 --> 00:05:05.640
=No way!
- He is so cute.
他超可爱

00:05:05.713 --> 00:05:09.070
Ah. (CLEARS THROAT)
Hey, Lisa, I was wondering if you...
丽萨 我在想...

00:05:09.154 --> 00:05:13.450
Ew! Gru touched Lisa! Gru touched Lisa!
格鲁摸了丽萨

00:05:13.742 --> 00:05:14.910
KIDS: Ew!

00:05:15.464 --> 00:05:17.162
Lisa's got Gruties!
丽萨得了“格鲁病”

00:05:17.288 --> 00:05:19.164
(KIDS SCREAMING)
丽萨得了“格鲁病”

00:05:24.742 --> 00:05:28.507
Scared? Of what? Women?
(CHUCKLES) No! That's bonkers!
害怕？怕什么？

00:05:28.721 --> 00:05:32.887
I just have no interest in going on a
date,that's all. Case closed.
我只是对约会不感兴趣而已 就这样

00:05:32.975 --> 00:05:36.181
I'm not scared. Of women. Or dates.
也不怕约会

00:05:36.623 --> 00:05:38.058
Let's go to bed.
睡觉吧

00:05:38.142 --> 00:05:39.143
(KISSES)

00:05:39.316 --> 00:05:40.811
Good night, Edith.
晚安 伊迪丝

00:05:41.854 --> 00:05:44.530
Good night, Margo. Whoa, whoa, whoa.
晚安 玛格

00:05:44.615 --> 00:05:46.442
Hold the horses. Who are you texting?
你给谁发短信呢？

00:05:46.567 --> 00:05:48.110
No one. Just my friend Avery.
没有谁 是我朋友艾弗里

00:05:48.323 --> 00:05:52.998
Avery. (STAMMERING) Avery?
Is that a girl's name or a boy's name?
艾弗里 艾弗里吗？

00:05:53.334 --> 00:05:54.533
Does it matter?
这重要吗？

00:05:54.727 --> 00:05:58.037
No, no, it doesn't matter
unless it's a boy!
不 这不重要

00:05:58.203 --> 00:06:00.372
I know what makes you a boy.
我知道为什么你是男生

00:06:00.689 --> 00:06:01.734
Uh, ooh,
你知道？

00:06:02.029 --> 00:06:03.209
you do?
你知道？

00:06:04.399 --> 00:06:05.794
Your bald head.
因为你是光头

00:06:06.789 --> 00:06:08.339
Oh, yes.
是啊

00:06:08.567 --> 00:06:10.231
It's really smooth.
它好光滑

00:06:10.496 --> 00:06:14.219
Sometimes I stare at it,
and imagine a little chick popping out.
就在想会不会有小鸡蹦出来

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:16.221
Peep peep peep.

00:06:17.486 --> 00:06:19.391
Good night, Agnes.
晚安 艾格妮丝

00:06:20.734 --> 00:06:22.436
Never get older.
永远别长大

00:06:34.406 --> 00:06:35.449
(SPEAKING MIONIONESE)
（果冻检验区）

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:38.744
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:06:47.086 --> 00:06:49.004
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:06:52.466 --> 00:06:54.551
♪(SINGING IN MINIONESE) ♪

00:06:57.054 --> 00:06:58.097
Hey, oh! (CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:00.432
Uh... (CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:07:00.557 --> 00:07:01.600
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:07:01.657 --> 00:07:02.851
Okay, okay. (CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:07:02.977 --> 00:07:04.019
(BLOWS RASPBERRY)

00:07:05.229 --> 00:07:06.355
(SCREAMING)

00:07:09.775 --> 00:07:12.319
(YELLING IN MINIONESE)

